,"work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013","text":"開逕邀之戰敗退還郫縣廣等又移營屯箭牽橋方明等破其六營乘勝追奔逕至廣漢廣等走還涪及五城四月十日發道濟喪五月方進軍向涪城張尋唐頻渡水拒戰方明擊破之生擒僞驃騎將軍雍秦二州刺史司馬龍伸斬之龍伸道助也州吏嚴道度斬嚴遐首廣等並奔散涪蜀皆平俄而張尋攻破陰平復與道養合帛氏奴攻廣漢費淡督將軍种松等與戰斬其梁州刺史杜承等百餘級九月益州刺史甄法崇至成都誅費謙之道濟喪及方明等並東反道養等領二千餘家逃於郪山其餘羣賊亦各擁戶藏竄出為寇盜不絕十二","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"n7b_moy_zp3"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"方明","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_15v_yeo"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"n7b_moy_zp3"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"道濟","kind":"person","person_id":"8lh_jgi_l6a_*B"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"張尋","kind":"person","person_id":"g9b_qdj_bh3"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"唐頻","kind":"person","person_id":"06f_y7r_4z1"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"方明","kind":"person","person_id":"l26_15v_yeo"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0084","start":84,"end":88,"surface":"司馬龍伸","kind":"person","person_id":"g5q_uxb_7wo_B","resolution_note":"原文明龍伸道助也；司馬是僭號/冒稱語境，不推晉皇室真父系。","interpretation_note":"原文明龍伸道助也；司馬是僭號/冒稱語境，不推晉皇室真父系。"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"龍伸","kind":"person","person_id":"g5q_uxb_7wo_B"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"道助","kind":"person","person_id":"g5q_uxb_7wo_B"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0097","start":97,"end":100,"surface":"嚴道度","kind":"person","person_id":"i6r_7ea_ffc"},{"id":"c-songshu-045-wyd1739-liucui:p013:m0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface